  "description": "YITAMOTOR 42\" Skid Steer Pallet forks. This skid steer pallet forks blade has 2500 lbs Bearing Capacity, Can easily and quickly haul lumber, and firewood, move fence posts, hay bales, etc.\nFitment\nThe frontier pallet fork fits a slotted skid steer pallet fork frame for use with Kubota, John Deere, Bobcat skid steers loaders tractors.\nFeatures\n2500LBS Load Bearing & Towing Capacity\nYITAMOTOR 42\" skid steer pallet fork is made using premium stainless steel so it can easily carry heavy loads, tow trailers, and other tractor implements.\nRemovable Pallet Fork Blades\nThe pallet fork frame features a slot for easy installation or removal of pallet fork blades; Grants a 17\"-37\" adjustable distance between pallet fork blades.\nWide Range of Uses\nThe pallet fork can be used with a 2\" receiver to tow trailers and tools or be used with hay spears to carry straw bales.\nCompatibility\nThis skid steer fork is suitable for skid steer, tractor, and loaders such as Bobcat, and Kubota (Notice: It doesn't fit John Deere unless you have John Deere loader mounting brackets).\nProduct Dimensions\nThe skid steer fork's total weight: 185.19 lbs, pallet fork blade length: 42\", pallet fork blade width: 4\", and pallet fork blade height: 22\"; Package includes: 1x pallet fork frame, 2 x pallet fork blades.",
